# XLNT Studio — Custom Ableton MCP Build Guide

**Goal:** The best Ableton AI integration in existence — hybrid TCP/UDP control, a library analyst that knows every sound you own, a plugin dictionary the agent can act on, and an audio feedback pipeline that gives the AI ears.

**Jargon rule:** every technical term gets a plain-English translation the first time it appears, marked with →.

---

