## Phase 0 — Foundations (Day 1, ~1 hour)

### 0.1 Prerequisites checklist

- [ ] **Python 3.10+** — `python --version` to check
- [ ] **Git** — `git --version`
- [ ] **uv** (fast Python package manager, optional but recommended): `pip install uv`
- [ ] **FFmpeg** (audio file swiss-army knife, needed later for the analyst): download from ffmpeg.org, add to PATH
- [ ] **Claude Desktop** installed on the Alienware
- [ ] **Claude Code** installed (`npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code`) — this is your coding workshop where the agent edits the repo with you

### 0.2 Create the monorepo

→ *A monorepo is one repository containing all related projects, instead of scattering them across many repos. Right choice here because the pieces share code (the analysis functions serve both the library analyst and the audio ears).*

```bash
mkdir xlnt-studio && cd xlnt-studio
git init
gh repo create xlnt-studio --private --source=. # or create on github.com manually
```

