## Phase 5 — The Soul: Style Cookbook + Actual Tracks (forever)

- [ ] One recipe doc per style in `/skills`, built from dissecting reference tracks together — e.g., `tape-b-dub-bounce.md`, `ote-texture-beds.md`, `griz-funk-pocket.md`
- [ ] Each recipe: arrangement math, sound palette (with `find_sounds` queries!), signature techniques, mix notes — concrete Ableton steps
- [ ] **The rule that keeps this honest:** agent automates the mechanical 70% (setup, sound-finding, MIDI drafts, gain staging); you own the sacred 30% (what it says, how it feels, when it's done)

