| 1 | Phase 0 + 1 | Repo live, Producer Pal running, hybrid server passing smoke tests, param_dump working on Serum |
| 2 | Phase 2 start + first track sketch | Scanner + analysis on test folder; a track in progress using the tools |
| 3 | Phase 2 finish + Phase 3 seed | Full library scanned, `find_sounds` live, 6 AGT racks saved |
| 4 | Phase 4 | Spectrogram + LUFS pipeline; first AI-assisted mix review |
| ongoing | Phase 5 | Recipes and dictionary grow as walls are hit; tracks ship |

**Anti-procrastination clause:** at least one *musical* session per week from Week 2 onward, even while building. The tools serve the tracks — never the reverse.
